/-!
# Proofs: known answers for G1MSM

The cases of `msm_G1_bls.json` with at most 4 pairs, and every case of `fail-msm_G1_bls.json`, in `assets/eip-2537` of `ethereum/EIPs`, at commit `faaa35fff856a109c40d291e612447fadc2095fe`.

The other cases repeat the same products and sums over up to 149 pairs.

The kernel takes about a second per pair, so all of them would take it hours.

Each successful case runs with the gas it lists, which is the price, and each failing case with the price.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace EthLib.Execution.Evm.Precompiles.Bls12381.KnownAnswers

